    {
      "id": "p0117-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Ore is primarily a masculine pronoun, but female characters use it on occasion too. This makes them sound tough, manly, and intimidating.",
        "raw": "Ore is primarily a masculine pronoun, but female characters use it on\noccasion too. This makes them sound tough, manly, and intimidating.",
